    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Mark of Warding Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Improved Intuition.</strong> When you use the Warder's Intuition benefit of your Mark of Warding feat, you can roll 1d6 instead of 1d4.</p><p><strong>Improved Warding.</strong> When a creature makes an attack roll against you or a creature you can see within 30 feet of you, you can take a Reaction to impose Disadvantage on that roll. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-vL0RV6FkDK5msFS5\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Improved Intuition: change the bonus of the <em>Warder's Intuition</em> effect of your Mark of Warding feat from 1d4 to 1d6.</p></section>",
